OL,3,GNEWSAMore to come on devolution of
OL,4,AWelsh justice, says UK minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK government minister says the
OL,7,F"potential is high" for control of
OL,8,Fparts of the criminal justice system to
OL,9,Fpass from Westminster to Wales.
OL,11,FThe devolution of policing and prisons
OL,12,Fare key demands of the Plaid Cymru
OL,13,FWelsh government, which has been in
OL,14,Fpower since May.
OL,16,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris said
OL,17,Fconversations are taking place with the
OL,18,FCardiff administration. While they were
OL,19,F"further ahead" on youth justice, he
OL,20,Fsaid there was "more to come".
