OL,3,GNEWSAMore to come on devolution of
OL,4,AWelsh justice, says UK minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fpreviously said he is "open" to
OL,8,Fdevolving policing.
